# Asset map changes

Read `docs/asset-map-agent-guide.md` before changing or supplementing asset relationships.

- Scanner-derived facts and manual annotations are separate ownership layers.
- Use stable node IDs returned by the current map. Do not guess identifiers.
- Uncertain relations remain `candidate` until deterministic evidence or an administrator confirms them.
- Never store API keys, passwords, tokens, cookies, private keys, or 1Password references in the map.
- Create a named version after a coherent Agent-authored change.
- Restores affect only the manual layer. They must not modify cloud resources or scanner source tables.
